## Quick Reference: Decision Tree

```
Need to distribute data across N servers?
│
├── Topology rarely changes, small cluster (< 10 nodes)?
│   └── Fixed hash slots (Redis approach) — simpler to reason about
│
├── Topology changes frequently, elastic scaling needed?
│   └── Consistent hashing with virtual nodes
│       │
│       ├── Even key distribution?     → Virtual nodes handle this
│       ├── Even traffic distribution? → Add read replicas or key salting
│       └── Fault tolerance?           → Combine with replication (Raft/Paxos)
│
└── Using a managed service (DynamoDB, Cassandra)?
    └── Just mention it handles this under the hood — don't reinvent
```

